      "writtenOn": "2019-08-12T18:53:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree with Keith. vapier@ had similar suggestions when I was adding docs to servo (https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/third_party/hdctools/+/1741719/9/docs/sitemap.md#16)\n\nIt\u0027s best to be completely unambiguous esp. since people outside of Google (partners, etc) are involved. We may have contributors that are less familiar with low-level concepts, so it\u0027s nice to be able to point them to a single place to help them get up to speed.",
